SUMMARY:Fall Shopping Package at Kitchen Kettle Village
DESCRIPTION:Grab a friend and plan a day of shopping this fall in the Village\nBook your Fall Shopping Package September 1st through October 31st\, 2026 (redemptions through 12/31/26)  \nReserve the 2026 Fall Shopping Package for just $45* — a $120+ value! \nEnjoy this shopping adventure throughout the Village. Start your journey at Village Handmade to pick up your branded shopping bag filled with offers and incentives for the participating shops. You can check in as early as 9am and as late as mid-afternoon (lunch is included with your package). \nShopping package includes: \n• Meal at The Harvest Cafe (up to a $20 value) Open Monday—Saturday\, 9am-5pm\n• Free 2-ounce Bottle of PA Maple Syrup from Aged & Cured\n• Free Stone Coaster from The Country Life\n• Free bag of Olive Basin Pasta from The Olive Basin\n• Free\, your choice\, Winter Scarf from Girls Day Out\n• Free 9-ounce jar of the NEW Honeycrisp Apple Butter from The Jam & Relish Kitchen\n• Free Women’s Speckled Knit Headband from The Deerskin Leather Shop\n• Free Aromatherapy Nasal Inhaler from Village Soap Company\n• Free pair of Fall or Christmas earrings $19.99 and under from The Jewelry Bar\n• Free Souvenir Mug from The Inn & Suites at Kitchen Kettle Village – pick up in the Lobby\n• Plus other special offers and incentives \nGrab a friend and treat yourself to a fabulous shopping day in the Village. Book your package soon to enjoy fun\, food\, and shopping! \n• $45 per package + tax and booking fee \n• Packages must be booked by October 31st\, 2026\, and redeemed by December 31\, 2026.
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/fall-shopping-package-kitchen-kettle/
LOCATION:Kitchen Kettle Village\, 3529 Old Philadelphia Pike\, (Route 340)\, Intercourse\, PA\, 17534\, United States
CATEGORIES:Black Friday,Children & Family Events,Christmas Events in Lancaster County,Food & Beverage Events,Holiday,Intercourse, Pennsylvania,Shopping,Thanksgiving
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://lancasterpa.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/kitchen-kettle-village-event-fall-shopping-package.webp
GEO:40.037432;-76.1096271
