SUMMARY:The 2026 Christmas Show: Winter Wonderland at American Music Theatre
DESCRIPTION:November 3 – December 30\, 2026\nCoupon \nStep into a storybook journey that whisks you from a charming Bavarian mountain village to the bustling merriment of Santa’s North Pole. Dazzling costumes\, glistening gowns\, and enchanting sets bring every magical moment to life – so vividly\, you’ll feel as though you’ve stepped straight into the pages of a holiday classic. It’s a heartwarming theatrical celebration of Christmas – rich with nostalgia\, sparkle\, and pure holiday delight. \nThere are many other Christmas events taking place in Lancaster County throughout the Christmas holiday season. See our Christmas in Lancaster page to learn more. \n\nCome Explore Our Lancaster Theaters and the Arts\n\n\nLive Theater\nLive Entertainment\nLive Music\n\n\n\nDinner Theaters\nMurder Mysteries\nThings To Do\n\n\n\nArtisan Collectives\nArt Galleries\nEvents Calendar
