DESCRIPTION:Free for children 4 & under – half-pound of butter per person to take home \n\n\n\nChurn butter by hand the way our family has for generations – then take home a half-pound of your own to enjoy. \n\n\n\n\n\n\nHand-churn fresh butter\nA generations-old tradition\nTake home ½ lb per person\nFun for all ages\n\n\n\n\n\nBook This Tour
