SUMMARY:Trains & Troops
DESCRIPTION:Greet our men and women in uniform\, including veterans\, re-enactors\, civilians and railroaders\, representing the Civil War era forward to today. Experience military and railroading displays of equipment\, vehicles\, uniforms\, memorabilia and much more\, all amid our historic trains! Salute our veterans and active-duty service personnel\, along with the Lancaster Red Rose Veterans Honor Guard\, Saturday at 11:00 a.m. and Sunday at 1:00 p.m. Be inspired by patriotic music performed by the Lampeter-Strasburg \nCommunity Band\, Saturday at 11:00 a.m.\, and enjoy The Victory Society’s World War II fashion show\, Saturday at 2:00 p.m.
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/trains-troops/
LOCATION:Railroad Museum of PA\, 300 Gap Road\, Strasburg\, 17579\, United States
CATEGORIES:Autumn,Community Interest,Military,Railroad,Strasburg, PA
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://lancasterpa.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Misc-Events-8.png
END:VEVENT
