SUMMARY:2026 Fall Fest\, Supporting North Museum & Millport Conservancy
DESCRIPTION:Thank you to all who came out for Fall Fest this year. North Museum and Millport Conservancy are grateful for your contribution to STEM education and environmental conservation in 2026! \nFall Fest is an ongoing collaboration between two outstanding non-profits and is a fundraising event to support both STEM education programming at North Museum\, and Millport Conservancy’s efforts to restore the Lititz Run through soil erosion control and stream management. \nVENUE\nMillport Conservancy\n737 E Millport Rd\, Lititz\, PA 17543
