SUMMARY:Pumpkin Madness Festival - Cherry-Crest Adventure Farm
DESCRIPTION:How many ways you can bid farewell to a pumpkin?\nJoin us as we embark on a thrilling quest to discover the ultimate pumpkin destruction techniques. From smashing and throwing to bowling\, dropping\, and carving\, there’s no shortage of excitement as we embark on this pumpkin demolition journey together. Bring along your leftover Halloween pumpkins or use some of ours – the choice is yours! So\, gather your friends and family\, and get ready to make memories. Let the smashing begin! \nFestival Highlights:\n\nPumpkin Smashing\nPumpkin Bowling\nPumpkin Putt-Putt\nPumpkin Chucking\nA HUGE Pumpkin Drop at 5:00pm!\nLive Music\nLocal Winery & Brewery\n\nThe excitement continues after dark with a glow in the dark pumpkin drop at 7pm and Fireworks at 8:30pm! \n\nFarm: 10am – 10pm\nFestival Activities: 1pm – 6pm\nFireworks: 8:30pm\n\n\nAdditional Fun Things To Do in Lancaster?\n\n\nKids’ Attractions\nFamily Attractions\nAmish Attractions\n\n\n\nThings To Do for Adults\nHistorical & Educational\nIndoor Things To Do\n\n\n\nTheater\, Music\, & The Arts\nMud Sales\nEvents Calendar\n\n \nTake a look at many more Things To Do throughout Lancaster County!
