SUMMARY:Live Music with Mackenzie Paige at Cherry Crest Adventure Farm
DESCRIPTION:Check out our amazing lineup of musicians that will be performing live right here at the farm! \nJoin us on select Friday evenings and Saturdays for toe-tapping tunes from our favorite bands. \nMackenzie Paige is originally from a farm in Lancaster\, Pennsylvania. She was raised in a very musical family\, and began songwriting and performing at a young age. She went on to study music at Messiah University. Mackenzie was blessed to spend a semester of college at the Contemporary Music Center in Nashville\, Tennessee. She has gleaned from artists such as Norah Jones\, Miranda Lambert\, and Natalie Hemby. She is a lover of all music\, but country has stolen her heart\, and feels like home. \n\nAdditional Fun Things To Do in Lancaster?\n\n\nKids’ Attractions\nFamily Attractions\nAmish Attractions\n\n\n\nThings To Do for Adults\nHistorical & Educational\nIndoor Things To Do\n\n\n\nTheater\, Music\, & The Arts\nMud Sales\nEvents Calendar\n\n \nTake a look at many more Things To Do throughout Lancaster County!
