SUMMARY:Veteran’s Day Luminary Trail Walk
DESCRIPTION:Set along the Winters Memorial Trail on Veterans Day\, Nov 11\, 2026\, Mainspring of Ephrata’s Winters Leadership Memorial Committee will continue the tradition they began on Veterans Day 2014 and host a moving Luminary Tribute to those who have served. \nNearly 400 luminaries will be placed at the site of Ephrata’s Veterans Plaza and along the Winters Memorial Trail. The luminaries\, each representing a brick that is placed in Veterans Plaza at the Winters Leadership Memorial\, will honor the more than 41 million men and women who have served in the US Military.
